{
  "id": "lift_and_drag",
  "title": "Lift and Drag",
  "description": "Lift and drag forces acting on a body like an air foil in a fluid flow.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Lift and Drag Calculator\n\nCalculate the lifting force, drag force, and required thrust power for a body in fluid flow using the following formulas:\n\n**Lifting Force:** FL = cL × ½ × ρ × v² × A\n\n**Drag Force:** FD = cD × ½ × ρ × v² × A\n\n**Required Thrust Power:** P = FD × v\n\nWhere:\n- FL = lifting force (N)\n- FD = drag force (N)\n- cL = lifting coefficient\n- cD = drag coefficient\n- ρ = density of fluid (kg/m³)\n- v = flow velocity (m/s)\n- A = body area (m²)\n- P = power (W)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "cL",
          "label": "Lifting Coefficient (cL)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.7
        },
        {
          "id": "cD",
          "label": "Drag Coefficient (cD)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.06
        },
        {
          "id": "rho",
          "label": "Fluid Density (ρ)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 1.2
        },
        {
          "id": "v",
          "label": "Flow Velocity (v)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "A",
          "label": "Body Area (A)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m²",
          "defaultValue": 20
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "FL",
          "label": "Lifting Force",
          "unit": "N",
          "formula": "inputs.cL * 0.5 * inputs.rho * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.A",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "FD",
          "label": "Drag Force",
          "unit": "N",
          "formula": "inputs.cD * 0.5 * inputs.rho * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.A",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "P",
          "label": "Required Thrust Power",
          "unit": "W",
          "formula": "(inputs.cD * 0.5 * inputs.rho * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.A) * inputs.v",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "FL_kN",
          "label": "Lifting Force",
          "unit": "kN",
          "formula": "(inputs.cL * 0.5 * inputs.rho * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.A) / 1000",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "FD_kN",
          "label": "Drag Force",
          "unit": "kN",
          "formula": "(inputs.cD * 0.5 * inputs.rho * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.A) / 1000",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "P_kW",
          "label": "Required Thrust Power",
          "unit": "kW",
          "formula": "((inputs.cD * 0.5 * inputs.rho * inputs.v * inputs.v * inputs.A) * inputs.v) / 1000",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
